{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43472","headline":"日暮山河清 · 无名氏","name":"日暮山河清","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天高爽气晶，驰景忽西倾。\n山列千重静，河流一带明。\n想同金镜澈，宁让玉壶清。\n纤翳无由出，浮埃不复生。\n荣纡分汉苑，表里见秦城。\n逸兴终难系，抽毫仰此情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}